{
  "zfVersion": "1.0",
  "name": "Daily journal",
  "description": "A daily journal as one inline step: the date, a mood, today's highlights, a line of gratitude and one intention for tomorrow — related to the rest of your notes on creation. Offline, no AI.",
  "author": "ZettelFlow",
  "difficulty": "easy",
  "canvas": {
    "filename": "Daily journal.canvas",
    "content": "{\"nodes\":[{\"id\":\"dj-root\",\"type\":\"text\",\"x\":-180,\"y\":-40,\"width\":340,\"height\":250,\"color\":\"1\",\"text\":\"Daily journal\",\"zettelflowConfig\":\"{\\\"slug\\\":\\\"dj\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Daily journal\\\",\\\"phase\\\":\\\"CAPTURE\\\",\\\"color\\\":\\\"1\\\",\\\"targetFolder\\\":\\\"Journal\\\",\\\"actions\\\":[{\\\"type\\\":\\\"calendar\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"dj-date\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Date\\\",\\\"hasUI\\\":true,\\\"key\\\":\\\"date\\\",\\\"zone\\\":\\\"frontmatter\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Date\\\",\\\"staticBehaviour\\\":false,\\\"enableTime\\\":false,\\\"format\\\":\\\"YYYY-MM-DD\\\"},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"selector\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"dj-mood\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Mood\\\",\\\"hasUI\\\":true,\\\"key\\\":\\\"mood\\\",\\\"zone\\\":\\\"frontmatter\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Mood\\\",\\\"staticBehaviour\\\":false,\\\"defaultOption\\\":\\\"ok\\\",\\\"options\\\":[[\\\"great\\\",\\\"Great\\\"],[\\\"good\\\",\\\"Good\\\"],[\\\"ok\\\",\\\"OK\\\"],[\\\"low\\\",\\\"Low\\\"]]},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"prompt\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"dj-highlights\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Highlights\\\",\\\"hasUI\\\":true,\\\"key\\\":\\\"highlights\\\",\\\"zone\\\":\\\"context\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Highlights\\\",\\\"placeholder\\\":\\\"What happened today?\\\",\\\"staticBehaviour\\\":false},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"prompt\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"dj-gratitude\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Grateful for\\\",\\\"hasUI\\\":true,\\\"key\\\":\\\"gratitude\\\",\\\"zone\\\":\\\"context\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Grateful for\\\",\\\"placeholder\\\":\\\"One thing...\\\",\\\"staticBehaviour\\\":false},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"prompt\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"dj-tomorrow\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"Tomorrow\\\",\\\"hasUI\\\":true,\\\"key\\\":\\\"tomorrow\\\",\\\"zone\\\":\\\"context\\\",\\\"label\\\":\\\"Tomorrow\\\",\\\"placeholder\\\":\\\"One intention...\\\",\\\"staticBehaviour\\\":false},{\\\"type\\\":\\\"tags\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"dj-tags\\\",\\\"hasUI\\\":true,\\\"staticBehaviour\\\":false}],\\\"onCreation\\\":[{\\\"type\\\":\\\"find-related\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"dj-rel\\\",\\\"hasUI\\\":false,\\\"key\\\":\\\"related\\\",\\\"zone\\\":\\\"frontmatter\\\",\\\"limit\\\":10}],\\\"body\\\":\\\"# {{date}}\\\\n\\\\n**Mood.** {{mood}}\\\\n\\\\n## Highlights\\\\n\\\\n{{highlights}}\\\\n\\\\n**Grateful for.** {{gratitude}}\\\\n\\\\n**Tomorrow.** {{tomorrow}}\\\\n\\\\n## Related\\\\n\\\\n{{related}}\\\\n\\\"}\"}],\"edges\":[]}"
  },
